- Master ICAO standard terminology proficiently and strengthen daily practice of standard communication sentences;
- Participate in more English communication scenarios in simulator training to accumulate practical experience;
- Listen to real-time ATC communications and watch aviation English teaching videos to improve listening and pronunciation;
- Conduct simulated English communication exercises with colleagues to correct expression mistakes targetedly;
- Review aviation English-related manuals and course content regularly to consolidate professional vocabulary and usage.
- 熟练掌握ICAO标准术语，日常强化标准通话句式练习；- 多参与模拟机训练中的英语通讯场景，积累实操经验；- 收听ATC实时通讯、观看航空英语教学视频，提升听力与发音；- 与同事开展英语通讯模拟练习，针对性纠正表达误区；- 定期复习航空英语相关手册与课程内容，巩固专业词汇与用法。
